{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9611e8c05ecaf62522bb809fa23e8a18dd0b444d379e3802d5d61429a0979cc0", "ja": "（書類作成に集中してたら、もうこんな時間か。\n少し休憩しようかな……）", "zh": "（专心制作文件，不知不觉已经这么晚了。\n稍微休息一下吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "3a12f9fcf8a5013a926bfb759f80bc7f48597d37d9cc79e1a57b4dae419f231f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、ちょうどよかった！\nちょっと頼みたいことが……って、あれ？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，来得正好！\n我正好有件事想拜托你……咦，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba54ef1a5392250a075c69d3b8aba4efaa32762e05cd8a9cd678fac1479db5c7", "ja": "なんか疲れた顔してない？\nもしかして、寝不足？　ダメだぞ、ちゃんと寝ないと！", "zh": "是不是感觉有点累？\n难道是没睡够？不行啊，得好好睡觉才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b16e1e1ab5631b69547663dcc0cc6ec6f71a914ee2a70142e8873e9c00264e3e", "ja": "お疲れさま、昴。いや、ちょっと仕事が立て込んでる\nだけだよ。それよりも、頼みたい事って？", "zh": "辛苦了，昴。没什么，只是工作有点忙而已。比起这个，你想拜托我的事是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "22b4143fefd3ec1e39e49344b03b3258cc6e23fb654786e896cadff49c835ae3", "ja": "あ、うん。それなんだけどさ……。\n実は……クレープ屋に一緒に行ってほしいんだっ！", "zh": "啊，嗯。是这样的……其实……我想请你陪我一起去可丽饼店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "e3da95e4006692d632b352d7236fbee80782def2299288b5f852799a62d827a7", "ja": "この間、差し入れでもらったクレープが、\nすっげーおいしくってさ～。", "zh": "前些天收到的可丽饼，真的超级好吃～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "b11b5c74869f12768e493c04c0ec5a8c077eb0b6e7379eec92a7ec8e24e539da", "ja": "だから、また食べたいなーって思ったんだけど。\nひとりでお店に行くのが、なんかハズくて……。", "zh": "所以我就想着再吃一次，不过一个人去店里，总觉得有点不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d69878a7a46444f67864215333023530bfbbda2a5e0c33e865aeaf092fdd95db", "ja": "ははっ、なるほど、そうか。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "36d1b04910760e450ee692c45deba780673327b6160be92a03215ab4f001e4c7", "ja": "わ、笑うなっての～！　こんなのガラじゃないって、\nオレもわかってるけどさ。", "zh": "别、别笑啊～！我也知道，这种事不像我会做的……但是嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4b5b73f671f6a77cf6155f0df13147b7e6ecc995dfc7e40c1d3474532d9608a5", "ja": "ああ、違うんだ。からかったんじゃなくて、\nかわいいお願いだなと思って、つい。", "zh": "啊，不是那样。我不是在捉弄你，只是觉得这个请求很可爱，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "2928c5f27ca5ab7faa7099e2c35ae48679ea0fe678ec2db31c1dcd9c04f577bc", "ja": "かわっ……！？　な、何言ってんだよ～！\nか、かわいいとか、もっと恥ずかしいってば。", "zh": "可爱……！？你、你在说什么啊～！\n说、说什么可爱啊，这样反而更让人害羞啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "4d5d5e7d30e70dea97399533217f33a5f481cff11b5ffb42b80439fcc3415bec", "ja": "ううっ……そ、それで！　どうなんだよ？\n忙しいみたいだし、無理にとは言わないけど。", "zh": "呜呜……那、那到底！　怎么样嘛？\n你好像挺忙的，我也不会勉强你就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e441c54d41d1b58ff9243ae7082aaa73def32ffefe25fe4d271b2186a89490c5", "ja": "喜んで付き合うよ。\nちょうど休憩しようと思ってたんだ。あ、そうだ！", "zh": "我很乐意奉陪。\n刚好我也正打算休息一下呢。啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dfcd6a34d205db21981ac4e83bca9ac5fe93a83a35928ee45f8c14672932bfd2", "ja": "スイーツバイキングのチケットがあるんだ。\nクレープもケーキもあるし、ここに行くのはどうだ？", "zh": "我有甜品自助餐的票。\n可丽饼和蛋糕都有，要不要去这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "26582207871a485d2c96376e8f0b91b9330fd400b5db94b9175f7266fa0ece4f", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？　それって、\nクレープも食べ放題ってこと？　やったーっ！", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？也就是说，连可丽饼也能随便吃！？太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0213_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "b5fb41ffd7117da0e5a9b7eaad09bd94b69a44fb5c6ef247502b1e2bd8db3453", "ja": "なら早く行こ、{$P$}！\nお店のスイーツ、オレたちで全部食っちゃおうぜ～♪", "zh": "那我们快走吧，{$P$}！\n店里的甜点，我们把它们全吃光吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
